---
description: Keep frontend layers thin; pages do not invent API clients or store
globs: frontend/src/**/*.{js,jsx}
alwaysApply: false
---

# Frontend layers

| Layer | Owns | Must not own |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `pages/` | screen composition | API fetch details, global store |
| `components/` | reusable UI | feature business rules |
| `features/` | feature-specific UI + local logic | shared app shell |
| `layouts/` | chrome around pages | page data loading |
| `hooks/` | shared React state/effects | one-off page markup |
| `services/` | API calls | JSX |
| `store/` | client state | UI rendering |
| `routes/` | route table | page implementation |

When asked for one piece (e.g. a login page), do not also add store, router, and API client files unless asked.
